{"id":"vod_md_2529","vodId":"2529","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"青之驱魔师","name_cn":"青之驱魔师","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"25集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230815-1/5cc80957b913ccf335251506e8243d57.jpg"},"summary":"奥村磷（冈本信彦 配音）自幼被神父藤本狮郎（藤原启治 配音）收养，某一日，磷发现了自己其实是撒旦之子的秘密，之后养父的惨死让磷下定居心走上了驱魔师的道路。磷所存在的世界被分为“物质界”和“虚无界”两大空间，人类生存于物质界，在虚无界中，则徘徊着凶残暴戾的魔鬼。身边接连发生的伤害事件让磷逐渐发现，某些虚无界的恶魔，趁虚而入潜入了人类世界。为了伸张正义保护同类，磷果断的担负起了驱魔的职责。在弟弟奥村雪男（福山润 配音）的帮助下，磷不断的向着真相前进，此时的磷也发现，造成这一切混乱的元凶，可能就藏在他们的身边。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-15 08:18:28","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230814/AU3oxcaz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230814/zNl748Py/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230814/pZS3OfdI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230814/fMPVzUui/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230814/zDRS4CGd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230814/NIDG9Fni/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230814/7kDxJNLH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230814/5rou7Wql/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230814/SU5PNXeR/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230814/GNhitMhu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230814/5UblXUur/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230814/EUhCptxy/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230814/kwU6ZlxS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230814/wVoDISOx/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230814/Wsewvwx5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.moduj